OL,3,GNEWSACoul Links golf course plan
OL,4,Arejected again by Scottish ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision has been welcomed
OL,7,Fconservationists but the group behind
OL,8,Fthe plan, Communities for Coul, said
OL,9,Fthe rejection was a "huge blow for the
OL,10,Farea".
